<Behavior #ai-multi-agent-domain-integration apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #member-holon-data-components (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMG>
      member / holon / detached-actor（delegate/subagent）的运行时状态 SHALL 由一个 MemberHolonDataComponents DataSubgraphContract 治理：member roster、holon governance、detached tasks 各自有声明的单一 owner 与 owned fact nodes；该 contract SHALL 经 Not-Owned-Here 显式声明它**不**拥有 conversation / history / LLM-context / turn 真源。member/holon/detached 状态的写入 SHALL 经该 contract 的 writeCommands（单写），SHALL NOT 由多个 ad-hoc 写入点直接改运行时状态。对应 gate G-control-depa-actor。
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMG>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #contract-shape { name = "MemberHolon data components contract" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #contract-declares-owned-and-not-owned [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMH>
              SHALL 声明 member roster / holon governance / detached tasks 的 owned fact nodes 与单一 owner
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMH>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMJ>
              SHALL 在 Not-Owned-Here 显式列出 History / LlmContext / ToolCall / TurnState 的 owned facts（这些不归 member/holon 拥有）
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMJ>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMK>
              MemberHolonDataComponents DataSubgraphContract
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMK>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMM>
              检查其 fact 治理
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMM>
            )>
            <Case #state-writes-through-write-commands (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMN>
              member roster / holon governance / detached tasks 状态变更
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMN>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMP>
              运行时改写该状态
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMP>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMQ>
              SHALL 经 contract 声明的 writeCommands（单写 owner），SHALL NOT 由多个 ad-hoc 直写点绕过 contract
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMQ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #extension-not-conversation-owner (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMR>
      member / holon / delegate / subagent 作为 AI domain extension，SHALL NOT 写入或拥有 conversation / history / LLM-context 真源；它们对 Conversation / LLM Context 的读取与贡献 SHALL 经 domain protocol（声明的 readViews 与 spine 单写语义管线），SHALL NOT 直达 conversation domain 内部写入器或运行时内部状态。对应 005「delegate/subagent 不成为 conversation truth owner」「member/holon 经 domain protocol 接入」。
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMR>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #domain-protocol-access { name = "Extension accesses conversation via domain protocol" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #no-extension-conversation-writes [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMS>
              SHALL NOT 调用 conversation domain 写入器（appendLiveHistory… / recordPromptRequest… / writeHistory/Prompt/SessionIndex / applyConversationCompaction / ConversationDomainRuntime 写）
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMS>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMT>
              对 Conversation/LLM Context 的贡献 SHALL 经 spine 单写语义管线注入，读取 SHALL 经声明的 readViews
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMT>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMV>
              member/holon/delegate/subagent 代码路径
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMV>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMW>
              边界检查其对 conversation/history/llm-context 的访问
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMW>
            )>
            <Case #member-holon-protocol-read (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMX>
              member/holon 需要读取 Conversation / LLM Context
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMX>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMY>
              访问这些真源
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMY>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMZ>
              SHALL 经 domain-protocol readViews（只读视图），SHALL NOT 直达 runtime 内部
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSMZ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #delegate-completion-mailbox-injection (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN0>
      delegate / subagent 的完成结果 SHALL 经 actor mailbox 注入回父 actor，注入唤醒等级 SHALL 遵循已确立的 wake-class 分流：sync_wait（同步等待）完成走高优先 mandatory_completion，detached（后台）完成走 low_priority_continuation（不打断主循环）。完成注入 SHALL NOT 由 delegate/subagent 直接写父 actor 的 conversation truth。对应 gate G-ai-turn-state / G-ai-tool-result。
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN0>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #mailbox-injection { name = "Delegate/subagent completion via mailbox" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #completion-enqueues-via-mailbox (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN1>
              delegate/subagent 完成
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN1>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN2>
              把完成结果交回父 actor
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN2>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN3>
              SHALL 经 mailbox enqueue 完成事件（childDone / semantic_background_result），SHALL NOT 直接写父 actor conversation/history 真源
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN3>
            )>
            <Case #wake-class-split-pinned [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN4>
              sync_wait 完成 SHALL 用 mandatory_completion（高优先）
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN4>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN5>
              detached 完成 SHALL 用 low_priority_continuation（低优先，不打断主循环）
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN5>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN6>
              完成的等待类型
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN6>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN7>
              决定注入唤醒等级
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN7>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #detached-delegate-single-flight (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN8>
      系统 SHALL 为 detached delegate 建立由 parent actor、agent type 与可选 task_key 确定的 active single-flight scope；缺省 task_key SHALL 使用 default scope，同 scope 已存在 pending、running 或 suspended task 时 SHALL 复用其 task_id 而不是创建新 child actor；调用者 MAY 以不同显式 task_key 表达合法并行，completed、failed、cancelled 或 interrupted task SHALL 不占有 active scope，sync_wait SHALL 保持既有语义。
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN8>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #detached-delegate-concurrency { name = "Detached delegate single-flight concurrency" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #default-scope-reuses-active-task [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN9>
              系统 SHALL 返回原 task_id、当前状态与 reused=true
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSN9>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNA>
              系统 SHALL NOT 创建第二个 child actor 或重复调度工作
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNA>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNB>
              同一 parent actor 与 agent type 的 default scope 已有 pending、running 或 suspended detached task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNB>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNC>
              父 actor 再次调用 detached delegate 且未提供 task_key
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNC>
            )>
            <Case #explicit-task-key-allows-parallelism (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSND>
              同一 parent actor 需要多个同类型 delegate 执行彼此独立的工作
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSND>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNE>
              调用者为每项工作提供不同的显式 task_key
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNE>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNF>
              系统 SHALL 允许这些 scope 各自创建并运行 detached task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNF>
            )>
            <Case #scope-isolated-by-owner-and-agent (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNG>
              不同 parent actor、不同 agent type 或不同 task_key 发起 detached 调用
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNG>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNH>
              registry 查询 active single-flight scope
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNH>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNJ>
              这些调用 SHALL NOT 错误复用彼此的 task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNJ>
            )>
            <Case #terminal-task-releases-scope (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNK>
              single-flight scope 对应 task 完成、失败或取消
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNK>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNM>
              终态事件被处理一次或重复处理
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNM>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNN>
              scope SHALL 被幂等释放，后续同 scope 调用 MAY 创建新 task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNN>
            )>
            <Case #recovery-preserves-resumable-active-ownership (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNP>
              runtime snapshot 恢复出一个仍可续跑且状态为 pending、running 或 suspended 的 detached task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNP>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNQ>
              父 actor 在恢复后调用相同 scope
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNQ>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNR>
              系统 SHALL 重建或保留 single-flight ownership 并复用恢复的 task
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNR>
            )>
            <Case #recovery-releases-interrupted-ownership [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNS>
              系统 SHALL 保留旧 task、scope 与 interrupted 状态供审计查询
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNS>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNT>
              系统 SHALL 释放旧 active ownership，创建新的 detached task，并返回 reused=false
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNT>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNV>
              runtime snapshot 中的 detached task 无法续跑并被恢复为 interrupted
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNV>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNW>
              父 actor 在恢复后调用相同 scope
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNW>
            )>
            <Case #sync-wait-unchanged (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNX>
              调用者使用 sync_wait delegate 模式
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNX>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNY>
              系统执行 delegate
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNY>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNZ>
              既有等待、结果交付与错误语义 SHALL 保持，不受 detached default scope 限制
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSNZ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #asynchronous-conversation-message-first-delivery (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP0>
      系统 SHALL 把 detached completion 等异步注入父 Conversation 的 committed message 首次 provider delivery 建模为工具无关、可持久恢复的显式生命周期：History message SHALL 具有跨 compaction 稳定的 message id，Session domain fact SHALL 以独立 delivery id 持有 pending/delivered；provider materialization SHALL 收集 request 实际包含的 pending message id，并只在成功 completion 后确认对应 delivery；provider failure、abort 与 recovery SHALL 保持 pending，通用摘要压缩 SHALL 原子保留受保护 message，且 message id、delivery fact 与状态 SHALL NOT 进入 provider-visible message、稳定 instructions 或 cache key。
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP0>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #asynchronous-message-delivery-lifecycle { name = "Asynchronous Conversation message first provider delivery" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #detached-completion-survives-failure-recovery-and-summary [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP1>
              Session delivery fact SHALL 保持 pending，且受保护 message 的稳定 message id 与完整正文 SHALL 跨恢复和压缩原子保留
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP1>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP2>
              摘要 provider request SHALL NOT 包含该 completion，系统 SHALL NOT 在首次成功交付前生成其 artifact 或 summary 替代
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP2>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP3>
              detached childDone 向父 Conversation 提交一个约 26KB completion message，首次包含它的父 provider call 失败
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP3>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP4>
              系统持久化并恢复 Conversation，追加输入触发通用摘要压缩，再构造下一 provider request
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP4>
            )>
            <Case #success-confirms-only-included-asynchronous-messages (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP5>
              provider request 实际包含一个或多个 pending asynchronous message id
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP5>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP6>
              provider completion 成功
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP6>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP7>
              系统 SHALL 只确认该 request 实际包含的 delivery id 为 delivered
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP7>
            )>
            <Case #failure-and-abort-keep-asynchronous-message-pending (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP8>
              包含 pending asynchronous message 的 provider call 失败、中止或未形成成功 completion
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP8>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP9>
              系统重试 provider call 或恢复 Conversation
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSP9>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPA>
              该 message SHALL 保持 pending，并继续拥有首次完整交付资格
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPA>
            )>
            <Case #asynchronous-delivery-metadata-remains-runtime-only [
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPB>
              message id、delivery id、delivery fact 与状态 SHALL 只存在于 History/Session/runtime materialization metadata
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPB>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPC>
              这些动态事实 SHALL NOT 出现在 provider-visible messages、稳定 instructions 或 cache key
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPC>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPD>
              不同轮次具有不同 pending/delivered asynchronous message 集合
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPD>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPE>
              系统构造普通 provider request、摘要 provider request与稳定 cache identity
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPE>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #canonical-holon-product-cutover (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPF>
      Product/bootstrap, AI Ctrl and AI Data SHALL share the canonical File-XNL Holon binding, TaskSpace coordinator and generic MemberRuntime execution chain; the retired VM autonomous Holon runtime SHALL be absent rather than retained as a fallback.
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPF>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #product-cutover { name = "Canonical Holon product cutover" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #ctrl-data-and-product-share-runtime (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPG>
              Product assignment, AI Ctrl or AI Data delegates work to an autonomous Holon.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPG>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPH>
              The request is accepted, recovered and completed.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPH>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPJ>
              All modes SHALL traverse the same frozen binding, TaskSpace, coordinator actor, MemberRuntime and settlement authorities without a per-mode Holon task state machine.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPJ>
            )>
            <Case #legacy-runtime-cannot-revive (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPK>
              Source, snapshot or history contains an old autonomous VM task representation.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPK>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPM>
              A fresh runtime loads or inspects it.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPM>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPN>
              It SHALL be rejected or exposed only by an explicit read-only audit decoder and SHALL NOT create a writer, fiber, lane, waiter or dispatch.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPN>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #canonical-holon-taskspace-pump (
      <Statement ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPP>
      Eidolon SHALL run one recoverable coordinator pump per deployment/Holon that continuously advances organization tasks through the canonical TaskSpace lifecycle and leaves all task facts under TaskSpace authority.
      </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPP>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #pump-lifecycle { name = "Canonical Holon task pump" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #automatic-frontier (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPQ>
              A subscribed TaskSpace has ready organization tasks and a frozen Holon execution binding.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPQ>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPR>
              The coordinator actor wakes or recovers.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPR>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPS>
              It SHALL drive the canonical ready frontier through claim, start, idempotent dispatch, result handoff and settlement without a manual processHolonTask call.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPS>
            )>
            <Case #crash-safe-attempt (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPT>
              A process stops at any claim, dispatch, result, settlement or Flow-consumption boundary.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPT>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPV>
              A fresh pump reconciles the TaskSpace and durable dispatch receipts.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPV>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPW>
              It SHALL resume the same fenced attempt, SHALL NOT duplicate an accepted effect and SHALL settle or notify exactly once.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPW>
            )>
            <Case #lease-and-stale-result (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPX>
              A claim lease is renewed, expires or is replaced by a later attempt.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPX>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPY>
              The pump receives a heartbeat or terminal result.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPY>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPZ>
              Canonical lease processors SHALL decide the transition and a stale attempt result SHALL NOT settle the current task.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSPZ>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
        <Suite #workflow-consumption { name = "Workflow consumption" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #ctrl-data-auto-consume (
              <Given ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ0>
              An AI Ctrl or AI Data node delegates work to a canonical Holon TaskSpace.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ0>
              <When ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ1>
              The pump settles the task.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ1>
              <Then ?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ2>
              Ctrl SHALL resume from the terminal receipt and Data SHALL consume validated material ports exactly once without owning task state.
              </?01M1A0RC212DZKG34XX8CVGSQ2>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
